# Mother Nexus is local-first and has no cloud fallback.
# This file is a reference; set any needed override in the launch environment.
# These optional paths configure retained kernel state, not Mother's home or
# model transport. Leave them unset to use the validated identity home's
# .nexus/nexus.db and .nexus/config.toml. Overrides must be non-empty absolute
# paths; empty or relative values fail closed. No credentials belong here.

# Retained database override: kernel/src/identity_home.rs, nexus_db_path().
# NEXUS_DB_PATH=/absolute/path/to/nexus.db

# Retained configuration override: kernel/src/config.rs, config_path().
# NEXUS_CONFIG_PATH=/absolute/path/to/config.toml
